{"4298400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dystopian Pet Simulator", "steam_appid": 4298400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/5de12afc123002a0e46de83a2983bef3.webp?t=1772238590\" width=610 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>terminal operator</strong> working in a grim, dystopian industrial substructure where mutated creatures are worth more alive than dead. Your job is simple and dirty: <strong>track the target, throw a net, and deliver the capture to your personal terminal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature generates <strong>passive income and experience</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rarer the creature, the faster your economy grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f62b6296f25fc806bd03687eec3620a1.poster.avif?t=1772238590\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f62b6296f25fc806bd03687eec3620a1.webm?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f62b6296f25fc806bd03687eec3620a1.mp4?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/2866402c8e54dc816e274e8c5a0c902e.webp?t=1772238590\" width=610 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t kill creatures - <strong>you exploit them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured mutants become assets that power your terminal, unlock new upgrades, and open the path to advanced evolutions. Combine pets, experiment with mutations, and increase their market value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more valuable the capture…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/0935e630de8104a6bd5cf689d7e480f2.poster.avif?t=1772238590\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/0935e630de8104a6bd5cf689d7e480f2.webm?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/0935e630de8104a6bd5cf689d7e480f2.mp4?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/ab777d28f59593ccb93166e647e8ff26.webp?t=1772238590\" width=610 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the zone solo or team up with <strong>up to 4 players in co-op</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, split the risks - or compete for the most valuable captures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/69fd6b917efa1b13dddc8cb5857a6b4d.poster.avif?t=1772238590\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/69fd6b917efa1b13dddc8cb5857a6b4d.webm?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/69fd6b917efa1b13dddc8cb5857a6b4d.mp4?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f80a0b59d57a9f4d9de267e51e7e9611.webp?t=1772238590\" width=610 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terminal upgrades expand your capabilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased storage capacity and efficiency    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced mobility and jump upgrades  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster and stronger passive economy growth  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your terminal becomes, the more control you gain over the substructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/673fac7afa9756b1b6192dfd4e5d6891.poster.avif?t=1772238590\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/673fac7afa9756b1b6192dfd4e5d6891.webm?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/673fac7afa9756b1b6192dfd4e5d6891.mp4?t=1772238590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for up to 4 players</strong> with lobbies and quick start    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity-based economy</strong> - rarer creatures mean higher profit  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and evolutions</strong> - combine pets to unlock new forms and increase value</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati